      "heading": "D — Accuracy and Verification",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## D — Accuracy and Verification, Section Eight Speed and Speed Limits\n\nSection D records the accuracy posture for the Section Eight speed rules. Every knowledge fact is required to trace to its cited handbook page, with the cited page stating the fact in full. Confidence is high across the section because every rule comes from the single pinned handbook edition. No fact needed a lower confidence flag, so no verification debt was opened and no external review was requested. Handbook wording is paraphrased throughout; no official sentence, table, or question is reproduced. No time-variable or location-variable fact appears beyond the pinned edition, so nothing required isolation as dynamic knowledge.\n",
